  "pDither": "Dithering",
  "pDitherHint": "How missing colors are simulated",
  "pDitherHelp": "Sierra: soft and clean (default). Floyd–Steinberg: more detail, more noise. Bayer: regular pattern, compresses well. None: banding on gradients but smaller files.",
